# Allowlist for apps/server/Dockerfile (the build context is the repo root).
# Cargo loads every workspace member, so the desktop crate's manifest, build
# script and sources come too; only the server is compiled.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/
!crates/
!apps/server/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/build.rs
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/
# The test stage: its gate script and the coverage policy it reads
!coverage-policy.json
!scripts/check-server.sh
!scripts/check-coverage-policy.mjs
